 I'm checking whether TYPO3 14 knows Kiswahili as a label language; after that I write the site language,\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bthe label file and the seed script.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mRunning \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command…\u001b[K\u001b[31;1H\u001b[29;3H\u001b[?25h"]
