[402.795497, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mHeader.fluid.html), but the site has only English, so it renders nothing. Should I add Kiswahili as \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bthe second site language (languageId 1, base /sw/, locale sw_KE.UTF-8, in config/sites/main and \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mInitia\u001b[13Gisation/Site/main)? → Kiswahili, /sw/ (Recommended)\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B· Which pages should have a Kiswahili version? The menu links only to pages that have one. → \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mTranslate pages via seed (Recommended)\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRead \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m file, ran \u001b[1m5\u001b[22m shell commands \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mI'm checking whether TYPO3 14 knows Kiswahili as a label language;\u001b[70Gafter\u001b[76Gthat\u001b[81GI\u001b[83Gwrite\u001b[89Gthe\u001b[93Gsite\u001b[98Glanguage,\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bthe label file and the seed script.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mSearched for \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m pattern, ran \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mKiswahili\u001b[13Gisn't\u001b[19Gin\u001b[22GTYPO3's\u001b[30Glist\u001b[35Gof\u001b[38Glanguages,\u001b[49Gso\u001b[52Gthe\u001b[56Gsitepackage\u001b[68Ghas\u001b[72Gto\u001b[75Gregister\u001b[84G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249msw\u001b[87G\u001b[39mitself,\u001b[95Gor\u001b[98Gevery\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3Glabel stays English.\u001b[24GNow the files:\u001b[39G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mSearching\u001b[13Gfor\u001b[17G\u001b[1m1\u001b[19G\u001b[22mpattern,\u001b[28Grunning\u001b[36G\u001b[1m1\u001b[38G\u001b[22mshell\u001b[44Gcommand…\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  $ for\u001b[13G in conf