e menu, and it now works: the site has Kiswahili at /sw/, with translated pages, home page and labels. Nothing is \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bcommitted yet, so the next step is your go for a \"Stage 14-languages\" commit. (turn off recaps in /config)\r\u001b[1B\u001b[23m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255msearching for ardhi there is no result\u001b[39m                                                                                                                       \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mLet me find out why the indexer skips the Kiswahili pages.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B  \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRan \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m shell commands \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2BThe\u001b[7Gindexer\u001b[15Gskips Kiswah\u001b[28Gli page\u001b[36G becaus\u001b[45Gthey \u001b[51Gave\u001b[55Gno content\u001b[66Gelements\u001b[75Gof\u001b[78Gtheir\u001b[84Gown,\u001b[89Gso\u001b[92Gtheir\u001b[98Gtitles\u001b[105Gnever\u001b[111Greach\u001b[117Gthe\u001b[121Gindex.\u001b[128GI'm\u001b[132Glooking\u001b[140Gat\u001b[143Gwhich\u001b[149Gke_search\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bextension\u001b[13Gpoints\u001b[20Gcould\u001b[26Gfix\u001b[30Gthat.\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · summary\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRan \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mThe ke_search index can take \u001b[33G modifyPagesIndexEntry\u001b[56Ghook\u001b[61Gthat\u001b[66Gswaps\u001b[72Gin\u001b[75Gthe\u001b[79GEnglish\u001b[87Gcontent\u001b[95Geach\u001b[100GKiswahili\u001b[110Gpage\u001b[115Gshows,\u001b[122Gso\u001b[125G\"ardhi\"\u001b[133Gwill\u001b[138Gmatch.\u001b[145GI'm\u001b[149Gchecking\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bthat\u001b[8Ghook's\u001b[15Gsignature\u001b[25Gnext.\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · summary\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;1