[1569.537426, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[39mUpdated \u001b[1mpackages/mtosafi_sitepackage/README.md\u001b[22m \u001b[38;2;56;166;96m+7\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;179;89;107m-2\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 133 \u001b[22m - the site settings of the header and the footer (the notice in the top bar, the\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[2m 134 \u001b[22m   opening hours,\u001b[29Gthe\u001b[33Gnote),\u001b[40Gbecause\u001b[48Ga\u001b[50Gsite\u001b[55Gsetting\u001b[63Ghas\u001b[67Gone\u001b[71Gvalue\u001b[77Gfor\u001b[81Gall\u001b[85Glanguages\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 135 \u001b[12G\u001b[22m-\u001b[14Gthe\u001b[18Gfilter\u001b[25G\"Show\u001b[31Gonly\"\u001b[37Gof\u001b[40Gthe\u001b[44Gsearch,\u001b[52Ga\u001b[54Grecord\u001b[61Gof\u001b[64Gthe\u001b[68G\"Search\u001b[76Gindex\"\u001b[83Gfolder\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G \u001b[5G \u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 136 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m- the search results: ke_search indexes a page translation only with content of                                                              \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m 137 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  its own language, so the index holds no Kiswahili page yet                                                                                 \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m   \u001b[2m 136 \u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 137 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mThe search in Kiswahili finds the Kiswahili pages by their title and by the English                                                          \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 138 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mcontent they show. ke_search writes an index entry for a page translation only                                                               \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 139 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mwhere it has content elements of its own; for a translation that falls back to                                                               \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 140 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mEnglish, `Classes/Search/IndexFallbackContentOfPageTranslations.php` (hook                                                                   \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 141 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m`modifyPagesIndexEntry`) gives it the English content. The news are indexed in                                                               \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 142 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mEnglish only and are not found from the Kiswahili search.                                                                                    \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 143 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m                                                                                                                                             \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m 144 \u001b[22m ## Editor\u001b[22G\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 145\u001b[11G\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[2m 146 \u001b[22m The setup creates the backend user group\u001b[53G\"Editors\",\u001b[64Gafter\u001b[70Gthe\u001b[74Gimport,\u001b[82Gon\u001b[85Gevery\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  Allowed by auto mode\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mSearching for \"ardhi\"\u001b[25Gnow \u001b[30Gorks. \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m/sw/tafuta?q=ardhi\u001b[39m returns \"Kodi ya ardh\u001b[77G\", and the \u001b[89Gesult\u001b[95Glinks\u001b[101Gto\u001b[104G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m/sw/mapato-malipo/kodi-ya-ardhi\u001b[39m.\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWhy it found nothing:\u001b[22m the search extension (ke_search) only indexes a page translation that has content elements in its own language. The Kiswahili pages\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bhave none\u001b[13Gof\u001b[16Gtheir\u001b[22Gown;\u001b[27Gthey\u001b[32Gshow\u001b[37Gthe\u001b[41GEnglish\u001b[49Gcontent\u001b[57Ginstead.\u001b[66GSo\u001b[69Geven\u001b[74Gtheir\u001b[80GKiswahili\u001b[90Gtitles\u001b[97Gnever\u001b[103Greached\u001b[111Gthe\u001b[115Gindex.\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mThe fix:\u001b[22m a new hook class, \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mClasses/Search/IndexFallbackContentOfPageTranslations.php\u001b[39m, is registered in \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mext_localconf.php\u001b[39m. When a site language falls back\u001b[157Gto\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BEnglish and a page translation has no content of its own, the hook gives that translation the English content. ke_search then stores it under the Kiswahili\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Btitle. \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mServices.yaml\u001b[39m marks the class public, which ke_search needs to create the hook with its dependency.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWhat I checked:\u001b[22m after re-indexing, the index holds 16 Kiswahili pages next to the 16 English ones. In Kiswahili, \"ardhi\" gives 1 result and \"land\" gives"]
[1569.53759, "o", "\u001b[156G4,\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bbecause the English content is indexed with them. The English search still gives the same 6 results for \"land\".\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mOne gap remains:\u001b[20G\u001b[22mthe\u001b[24Gnews\u001b[29Gare\u001b[33Gindexed\u001b[41Gin\u001b[44GEnglish\u001b[52Gonly,\u001b[58Gso\u001b[61Gthey\u001b[66Gdon't\u001b[72Gshow\u001b[77Gup\u001b[80Gin\u001b[83Gthe\u001b[87GKiswahili\u001b[97Gsearch.\u001b[105GThe\u001b[109GREADME\u001b[116Gnow\u001b[120Gsays\u001b[125Gthis.\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B  Nothing is committed yet.\u001b[29GThe\u001b[33Gnew\u001b[37Gfiles\u001b[43Gare\u001b[47Gthe\u001b[51Ghook\u001b[56Gclass,\u001b[63G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mseed-kiswahili.php\u001b[82G\u001b[39mand\u001b[86Gthe\u001b[90Gtwo\u001b[94G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249msw.*.xlf\u001b[103G\u001b[39mfiles;\u001b[110Gthe\u001b[114GREADME\u001b[121Gsection\u001b[129G\"Languages\"\u001b[141Gcovers\u001b[148Gthe\u001b[152Gsearch\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bbehaviour.\u001b[14GTell\u001b[19Gme\u001b[22Gif\u001b[25Gyou\u001b[29Gwant\u001b[34Gme\u001b[37Gto\u001b[40Gprepare\u001b[48Ga\u001b[50G\"Stage\u001b[57G14-languages\"\u001b[71Gcommit.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mSautéed\u001b[11Gfor\u001b[15G1m 6s ·\u001b[23Gdone 6:51 AM\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[3B❯ \r\u001b[38C\u001b[2B\u001b[K\u001b[42;1H\u001b[40;3H\u001b[?25h"]
[1751.338704, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H     \u001b[2m 135 \u001b[22m -\u001b[14Gthe filter \"Show only\" of the search, a record\u001b[61Gof\u001b[64Gthe\u001b[68G\"Search\u001b[76Gindex\"\u001b[83Gfolder\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 136 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m- the search results: ke_search indexes a page translation only with content of                                                              \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m 137 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  its own language, so the index holds no Kiswahili page yet                                                                                 \r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m6\u001b[12G\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 137 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mThe search in Kiswahili finds the Kiswahili pages by their title and by the English                                                          \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 138 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mcontent they show. ke_search writes an index entry for a page translation only                                                               \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 139 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mwhere it has content elements of its own; for a translation that falls back to                                                               \r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m40\u001b[12G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mEnglish, `Classe\u001b[29G/Search/I\u001b[40GexFallbackContentOfPageTranslations.php`\u001b[81G(hook \u001b[88G       \r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m41\u001b[12G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m`modifyPag\u001b[23GsIndexEntry`) gives \u001b[45G the English content.\u001b[67GThe n\u001b[73Gws \u001b[77Gre indexed in\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m42\u001b[12G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mEnglish only\u001b[25Gand are\u001b[33Gnot found \u001b[44Grom the Kiswahili search.  \u001b[72G    \u001b[77G     \u001b[83G    \u001b[88G  \r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m3\u001b[12G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m        \u001b[21G                                                           \u001b[81G     \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m 144 \u001b[22m ## Editors\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 145 \u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 146 \u001b[22m The setup creates the backend user group \"Editors\", after the import, on every\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  Allowed by auto mode\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mSearching for \"ardhi\" now works. \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m/sw/tafuta?q=ardhi\u001b[39m re\u001b[58Gu\u001b[60Gns \"Kodi ya ardhi\", and the \u001b[89Gesult\u001b[95Glinks\u001b[101Gto\u001b[104G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m/sw/mapato-malipo/kodi-ya-ardhi\u001b[39m.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWhy it found nothing:\u001b[25G\u001b[22mthe\u001b[29Gsearch\u001b[36Gextension\u001b[46G(ke_search)\u001b[58Gonly\u001b[63Gindexes\u001b[71Ga\u001b[73Gpage\u001b[78Gtranslation\u001b[90Gthat\u001b[95Ghas\u001b[99Gcontent\u001b[107Gelements\u001b[116Gin\u001b[119Gits\u001b[123Gown\u001b[127Glanguage.\u001b[137GThe\u001b[141GKiswahili\u001b[151Gpages\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3Ghave no\u001b[11Ge\u001b[13Gof their own; they show the English content instead. So\u001b[69Geven t\u001b[76Geir\u001b[80GKiswa\u001b[86Gili titles \u001b[98Gever reached the index.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2B\u001b[1mT\u001b[5Ge\u001b[7Gfix:\u001b[22m a new hook class, \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mClasses/Search/IndexFallbackContentOfPageTranslations.php\u001b[39m, is registered i\u001b[105G \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mext_localconf.php\u001b[39m. When a site\u001b[137Glanguage fa\u001b[149Gls back\u001b[157Gto\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BEnglish and a page\u001b[22Gtranslation has no\u001b[41Gcontent\u001b[49Gof its ow\u001b[59G, the ho\u001b[68Gk gives that translation the\u001b[97GEnglish conten\u001b[112G. ke_s\u001b[119Garch\u001b[124Gthen\u001b[129Gstores\u001b[136Git\u001b[139Gunder\u001b[145Gthe\u001b[149GKiswahili\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Btitle.\u001b[10G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mServices.yaml\u001b[24G\u001b[39mmarks\u001b[30Gthe\u001b[34Gclass\u001b[40Gpublic,\u001b[48Gwhich\u001b[54Gke_search\u001b[64Gneeds\u001b[70Gto\u001b[73Gcreate\u001b[80Gthe\u001b[84Ghook\u001b[89Gwith\u001b[94Gits\u001b[98Gdependency.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWhat I checked:\u001b[22m afte\u001b[24G re-indexing,\u001b[38Gthe i\u001b[44Gd\u001b[46Gx h\u001b[50Glds 16 Kiswa\u001b[63Gili pages nex\u001b[77G to\u001b[82Ghe 16 Englis\u001b[95G ones. In\u001b[105GKiswahili, \"ardhi\"\u001b[124Ggives 1 \u001b[135Gul\u001b[139Ga\u001b[142G \"land\" gives 4,\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bbecause the English content is\u001b[34Gindexed with them. Th\u001b[56G English s\u001b[67Garch still gives\u001b[84Gthe same 6 results for \"land\".\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2B\u001b[1mOne gap r\u001b[13Gmains:\u001b[22m th\u001b[23G news ar\u001b[32G \u001b[35Gdexed in English only, so t\u001b[63Gey don't show up in the Kiswahili s\u001b[99Garch.\u001b[105GThe README\u001b[116Gnow says thi\u001b[129G.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BNothing\u001b[11Gis\u001b[14Gcommitted\u001b[24Gyet.\u001b[29GThe\u001b[33Gnew\u001b[37Gfiles\u001b[43Gare\u001b[47Gthe\u001b[51Ghook\u001b[56Gclass,\u001b[63G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mseed-kiswahili.php\u001b[82G\u001b[39mand\u001b[86Gthe\u001b[90Gtwo\u001b[94G"]
[1751.338748, "o", "\u001b[38;2;177;185;249msw.*.xlf\u001b[103G\u001b[39mfiles;\u001b[110Gthe\u001b[114GREADME\u001b[121Gsection\u001b[129G\"Languages\"\u001b[141Gcovers\u001b[148Gthe\u001b[152Gsearch\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bbehaviour. Tell me if you\u001b[29Gwant me to prepare a \"Stage 14-languages\" commit.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GSautéed for 1m 6s · done 6:51 AM\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m※\u001b[3G\u001b[1mrecap: \u001b[22m\u001b[3mWe added Kiswahili as a second language so the header's language menu works, and the Kiswahili search now finds pages such as \"ardhi\". Nothing is \r\u001b[1B\u001b[23m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m\u001b[3mcommitted yet; say go if you want a \"Stage 14-languages\" commit. (turn off recaps in /config)\u001b[23m\u001b[39m\u001b[42;1H\u001b[40;3H\u001b[?25h"]
