[2235.73925, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 137 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mThe search in Kiswahili finds the Kiswahili pages by their title and by the English                                                          \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 138 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mcontent they show. ke_search writes an index entry for a page translation only                                                               \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 139 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mwhere it has content elements of its own; for a translation that falls back to                                                               \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 140 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mEnglish, `Classes/Search/IndexFallbackContentOfPageTranslations.php` (hook                                                                   \r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m41\u001b[12G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m`modifyPagesIndexEntry`) gives it\u001b[46Gthe Eng\u001b[55Gsh content. The\u001b[71Gnews are indexed\u001b[88Gi\u001b[90G     \r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m42\u001b[12G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mEnglish\u001b[20Gonl\u001b[25Gand are not found from\u001b[48Gthe Kiswahili sea\u001b[66Gch.    \u001b[74G           \u001b[86G    \r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m43\u001b[12G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m     \u001b[18G  \u001b[21G   \u001b[25G       \u001b[33G        \u001b[42G  \u001b[45G   \u001b[49G    \u001b[54G   \u001b[58G \u001b[60G           \u001b[72G    \u001b[77G     \u001b[83G    \u001b[88G  \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m 144 \u001b[22m ## Editors\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 145 \u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 146 \u001b[22m The setup creates the backend user group \"Editors\", after the import, on every\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  Allowed by auto mode\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mSearching\u001b[13Gfor\u001b[17G\"ardhi\"\u001b[25Gnow\u001b[29Gworks.\u001b[36G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m/sw/tafuta?q=ardhi\u001b[55G\u001b[39mreturns\u001b[63G\"Kodi\u001b[69Gya\u001b[72Gardhi\",\u001b[80Gand\u001b[84Gthe\u001b[88Gresult\u001b[95Glinks\u001b[101Gto\u001b[104G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m/sw/mapato-malipo/kodi-ya-ardhi\u001b[39m.\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B  \u001b[1mWhy it found nothing:\u001b[22m the\u001b[29Gsearch\u001b[36Gextension\u001b[46G(ke_search)\u001b[58Gonly\u001b[63Gindexes\u001b[71Ga\u001b[73Gpage\u001b[78Gtranslation\u001b[90Gthat\u001b[95Ghas\u001b[99Gcontent\u001b[107Gelements\u001b[116Gin\u001b[119Gits\u001b[123Gown\u001b[127Glanguage.\u001b[137GThe\u001b[141GKiswahili\u001b[151Gpages\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bhave\u001b[8Gnone\u001b[13Gof\u001b[16Gtheir\u001b[22Gown;\u001b[27Gthey\u001b[32Gshow\u001b[37Gthe\u001b[41GEnglish\u001b[49Gcontent\u001b[57Ginstead.\u001b[66GSo\u001b[69Geven\u001b[74Gtheir\u001b[80GKiswahili\u001b[90Gtitles\u001b[97Gnever\u001b[103Greached\u001b[111Gthe\u001b[115Gindex.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mThe fix:\u001b[12G\u001b[22ma\u001b[14Gnew\u001b[18Ghook\u001b[23Gclass,\u001b[30G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mClasses/Search/IndexFallbackContentOfPageTranslations.php\u001b[39m,\u001b[89Gis\u001b[92Gregistered\u001b[103Gin\u001b[106G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mext_localconf.php\u001b[39m.\u001b[125GWhen\u001b[130Ga\u001b[132Gsite\u001b[137Glanguage\u001b[146Gfalls\u001b[152Gback\u001b[157Gto\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BEnglish and a page translation \u001b[35Gas no content of its own, the hook gives that translation \u001b[94Ghe English cont\u001b[110Gnt. ke_search then stores it under t\u001b[147Ge Kiswahili\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Btitle. \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mServices.yaml\u001b[39m marks the class public, which ke_search needs to create\u001b[80Gthe hook with its depend\u001b[105Gn\u001b[107Gy.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2B\u001b[1mW\u001b[5Gat I checked:\u001b[22m after re-indexing, the index holds 16 Kiswahili pages next to the 16 English on\u001b[99Gs. In Kiswahili, \"ardhi\" giv\u001b[128Gs\u001b[130G1\u001b[132Gresult and \"land\" gives 4,\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bbecau\u001b[9Ge\u001b[11Gthe\u001b[15GEnglish co\u001b[26Gten\u001b[30G is\u001b[34Gindexed wi\u001b[45Gh \u001b[48Ghem. The E\u001b[59Gglish\u001b[65Gsearch still gives the same\u001b[93G6 results for \"la\u001b[111Gd\".\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mOne gap remains:\u001b[20G\u001b[22mthe\u001b[24Gnews\u001b[29Gare\u001b[33Gindexed\u001b[41Gin\u001b[44GEnglish\u001b[52Gonly,\u001b[58Gso\u001b[61Gthey\u001b[66Gdon't\u001b[72Gshow\u001b[77Gup\u001b[80Gin\u001b[83Gthe\u001b[87GKiswahili\u001b[97Gsearch.\u001b[105GThe\u001b[109GREADME\u001b[116Gnow\u001b[120Gsays\u001b[125Gthis.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BNothing\u001b[11Gis committed ye\u001b[27G. The new files are\u001b[50G hook class, \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mseed-kiswahili.php\u001b[39m and the two \u001b[38;2;177;185;249msw.*.xlf\u001b[104G\u001b[39miles; the README\u001b[121Gsection\u001b[129G\"Languages\"\u001b[141Gcovers\u001b[148Gthe\u001b[152Gsearch\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bbehaviour.\u001b[14GTell\u001b[19Gme\u001b[22Gif\u001b[25Gyou\u001b[29Gwant\u001b[34Gme\u001b[37Gto\u001b[40Gprepare\u001b[48Ga\u001b[50G\"Stage\u001b[57G14-languages\"\u001b[71Gcommit.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GSautéed for 1m 6s · done 6:51 AM\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m※\u001b[3G\u001b[1mrecap: \u001b[22m\u001b[3mWe added Kiswahili as "]
[2235.739294, "o", "a second language so the header's language menu works, and the Kiswahili search now finds pages such as \"ardhi\". Nothing is \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bcommitted yet; say go if you want a \"Stage 14-languages\" commit. (turn off recaps in /config)\r\u001b[1B\u001b[23m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mHow to translate the contact form?\u001b[39m                                                                                                                           \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m✽\u001b[3GBillowing… \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[3B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[38C\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · esc to interrupt\u001b[39m\u001b[42;1H\u001b[40;3H\u001b[?25h"]
