sage\u001b[39m, \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mcontact.finisher.EmailToReceiver.subject\r\u001b[4C\u001b[2B\u001b[39mError \u001b[12Gessage\u001b[19G    \u001b[24G       \u001b[42G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mval\u001b[46Gdation.error.ph\u001b[63Ge.1221565130\u001b[39m, or \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mvalidation.error.1221560910\u001b[39m for one\u001b[116Gshared\u001b[123Gby\u001b[126Gall\u001b[130Gfields\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B└\u001b[32G┴\u001b[137G┘\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BThe English text in the form's YAML stays as the source. Any key missing from the \u001b[38;2;177;185;249msw\u001b[39m file falls back to that English text.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2B\u001b[1mTwo things the YAML can't keep as they are:\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mCustom error messages:\u001b[28G\u001b[22mthe\u001b[32Gmessages\u001b[41Gwritten\u001b[49Gdirectly\u001b[58Ginto\u001b[63Gthe\u001b[67GYAML\u001b[72G(the\u001b[77Gphone\u001b[83Gnumber\u001b[90Gand\u001b[94Gthe\u001b[98Gtwo\u001b[102G\"I'm\u001b[107Gnot\u001b[111Ga\u001b[113Grobot\"\u001b[120Gmessages)\u001b[130Gare\u001b[134Greturned\u001b[143Gas\u001b[146Gthey\u001b[151Gare\u001b[155Gand\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  never translated. They have to move into the\u001b[50GXLF\u001b[54Gunder\u001b[60Gthe\u001b[64Gkeys\u001b[69Gabove.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mStandard er\u001b[17Gor messages:\u001b[22m the default messages (\"This\u001b[58Gfield is\u001b[67Gmandatory\", \"invalid em\u001b[91Gil\u001b[94Gaddress\") come from EXT:form'\u001b[124G own l\u001b[131Gb\u001b[133Gls. TYPO3\u001b[143Ghas no Kiswahili\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bfor them (it doesn't even know\u001b[36Gthe la\u001b[43Gguage,\u001b[50Gwhich is why th\u001b[66G \u001b[68Gitepackage\u001b[79Gregisters\u001b[89G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249msw\u001b[39m).\u001b[94GSo\u001b[97G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249msw.form.xlf\u001b[109G\u001b[39mneeds\u001b[115Gthem\u001b[120Gtoo,\u001b[125Gas\u001b[128G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mvalidation.error.<code>\u001b[152G\u001b[39mfor\u001b[156Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gvalidators the form uses: NotEmpty, StringL\u001b[49Gngth, EmailAd\u001b[63Gre\u001b[66Gs, RegularExpression.\u001b[88G\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mOutside the form:\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GThe\u001b[9Gheader\u001b[16G\"Write\u001b[23Gto\u001b[26Gus\"\u001b[30Gand\u001b[34Gthe\u001b[38Gsidebar\u001b[46Gtexts\u001b[52Gare\u001b[56Gordinary\u001b[65Gcontent\u001b[73Gelements.\u001b[83GThey\u001b[88Gstay\u001b[93GEnglish\u001b[101Guntil\u001b[107Gthe\u001b[111GContact\u001b[119Gpage\u001b[124Ggets\u001b[129GKiswahili\u001b[139Gcontent,\u001b[148Gwhich\u001b[154Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  seed script could\u001b[23Gdo\u001b[26Glike\u001b[31Git\u001b[34Gdoes\u001b[39Gfor\u001b[43Gthe\u001b[47Ghome\u001b[52Gpage.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\u001b[42;1H\u001b[40;3H\u001b[?25h"]
[2259.723381, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[4C\u001b[36BThe\u001b[9Gmail\u001b[14Gto\u001b[17Gthe\u001b[21Gmunicipality\u001b[34Gwould\u001b[40Gshow\u001b[45Gits\u001b[49Gfield\u001b[55Glabels\u001b[62Gin\u001b[65GKiswahili\u001b[75Gwhen\u001b[80Gsomeone\u001b[88Gwrites\u001b[95Gfrom\u001b[100G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m/sw/\u001b[39m,\u001b[106Gbecause\u001b[114Gthe\u001b[118Gmail\u001b[123Gtemplate\u001b[132Gtranslates\u001b[143Gthem\u001b[148Gtoo.\u001b[153GIf\u001b[156Gthe\u001b[42;1H\u001b[40;3H\u001b[?25h"]
