[2766.330992, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mTwo things the YAML can't keep as they are:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m- \u001b[1mCustom error messages:\u001b[22m the message\u001b[40G written directly into th\u001b[66G YAML (the phone number and the two \"I'm\u001b[107Gnot a robot\"\u001b[120Gm\u001b[122Gssages)\u001b[130Gare\u001b[134Greturned\u001b[143Gas\u001b[146Gthey\u001b[151Gare\u001b[155Gand\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bnever\u001b[11Gtranslated.\u001b[23GThey\u001b[28Ghave\u001b[33Gto\u001b[36Gmove\u001b[41Ginto\u001b[46Gthe\u001b[50GXLF\u001b[54Gunder\u001b[60Gthe\u001b[64Gkeys\u001b[69Gabove.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- \u001b[1mStandard\u001b[14Gerror mess\u001b[25Gges:\u001b[22m the default messages\u001b[51G(\"This\u001b[58Gfield\u001b[64Gis\u001b[67Gmandatory\",\u001b[79G\"invalid\u001b[88Gemail\u001b[94Gaddress\")\u001b[104Gcome\u001b[109Gfrom\u001b[114GEXT:form's\u001b[125Gown\u001b[129Glabels.\u001b[137GTYPO3\u001b[143Ghas\u001b[147Gno\u001b[150GKiswahili\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gfor them (it doesn't even know th\u001b[39G language, whi\u001b[54Gh is why\u001b[67Gsitepackage registers \u001b[38;2;177;185;249msw\u001b[39m).\u001b[94GSo \u001b[38;2;177;185;249msw.form.xlf\u001b[39m needs them\u001b[120Gtoo, as \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mvalidation.error.<code>\u001b[39m for the\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bvalida\u001b[12Gors the form uses: No\u001b[34GEmpty,\u001b[41GStringL\u001b[49Gngth, EmailAddress,\u001b[69GRegularExpression.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mOutside the form:\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GThe header\u001b[16G\"Write to us\" and the sidebar texts are ordinary content elements. They\u001b[88Gstay\u001b[93GEnglish\u001b[101Guntil\u001b[107Gthe\u001b[111GContact\u001b[119Gpage\u001b[124Ggets\u001b[129GKiswahili\u001b[139Gcontent,\u001b[148Gwhich\u001b[154Gthe\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bseed\u001b[10Gscript\u001b[17Gcould\u001b[23Gdo\u001b[26Glike\u001b[31Git\u001b[34Gdoes\u001b[39Gfor\u001b[43Gthe\u001b[47Ghome\u001b[52Gpage.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- The mail to the\u001b[21Gmunicipality\u001b[34Gwould\u001b[40Gshow\u001b[45Gits\u001b[49Gfield\u001b[55Glabels\u001b[62Gin\u001b[65GKiswahili\u001b[75Gwhen\u001b[80Gsomeone\u001b[88Gwrites\u001b[95Gfrom\u001b[100G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m/sw/\u001b[39m,\u001b[106Gbecause\u001b[114Gthe\u001b[118Gmail\u001b[123Gtemplate\u001b[132Gtranslates\u001b[143Gthem\u001b[148Gtoo.\u001b[153GIf\u001b[156Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Goffic\u001b[11G should always\u001b[26Gget\u001b[30GE\u001b[32Gglish\u001b[38Gmails, th\u001b[48G \u001b[50Gemplate ca\u001b[61G be\u001b[65Gpi\u001b[68Gn\u001b[70Gd to Engli\u001b[81Gh.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BShould I build it: the tr\u001b[29Gnslati\u001b[36Gn file for the whole form, the error message\u001b[81G \u001b[83Goved\u001b[88Gout of\u001b[95Gthe YAML, and the Contact pag\u001b[125G con\u001b[131Gn\u001b[133G \u001b[135Gdded to\u001b[146G seed script?\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GChurned for 24s · done 7:02 AM\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m※\u001b[3G\u001b[1mrecap: \u001b[22m\u001b[3mThe site now has a Kiswahili version with a working language menu and search, all still uncommitted. I explained how to translate the contact form, \r\u001b[1B\u001b[23m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m\u001b[3mand next I'm waiting for your go to build that translation. (turn off recaps in /config)\r\u001b[2B\u001b[23m\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mgo\u001b[39m                                                                                                                                                           \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mBuilding\u001b[12Git.\u001b[16GFirst\u001b[22Gthe\u001b[26Gerror\u001b[32Gcodes\u001b[38Gand\u001b[42Gthe\u001b[46Gtexts\u001b[52GEXT:form\u001b[61Guses\u001b[66Gby\u001b[69Gdefault:\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mSearched for \u001b[1m3\u001b[22m patterns, ran \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mOur\u001b[7Gfile\u001b[12Gat\u001b[15Gkey\u001b[19G20\u001b[22Gis\u001b[25Gread\u001b[30Gbefore\u001b[37Gthe\u001b[41Gcore's\u001b[48G(10).\u001b[54GNow\u001b[58Gchecking\u001b[67Gwhere\u001b[73Gthe\u001b[77GAltcha\u001b[84Gwidget\u001b[91Ggets\u001b[96Gits\u001b[100Gown\u001b[104Gtexts\u001b[110G(\"I'm\u001b[116Gnot\u001b[120Ga\u001b[122Grobot\"):\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRan \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m shell commands \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mThe\u001b[7GAltcha\u001b[14Gwidget\u001b[21Ghas\u001b[25Gits\u001b[29Gown\u001b[33Gtexts\u001b[39G(\"I'm\u001b[45Gnot\u001b[49Ga\u001b[51Grobot\",\u001b[59G\"Verifying…\"),\u001b[74Gwhich\u001b[80Gthe\u001b[84Gextension\u001b[94Gpasses\u001b[101Gin\u001b[104Gthrough\u001b[112Gan\u001b[115Gempty\u001b[121Gpartial.\u001b[130GChecking\u001b[139Gwhich\u001b[145Gkeys\u001b[150Gthe\u001b[154Gwidget\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3Gtakes and whether it ships K\u001b[32Gswahili:\u001b[41G\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mRunning \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command…\u001b[K\r\u001b[16C\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m9\u001b[38Gthought for 3s)\u001b[39m\u001b[42;1H\u001b[40;3H\u001b[?25h"]
