[2769.093584, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G  never translated. They have to move into the\u001b[50GXLF\u001b[54Gunder\u001b[60Gthe\u001b[64Gkeys\u001b[69Gabove.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mStandard er\u001b[17Gor messages:\u001b[22m the default messages (\"This\u001b[58Gfield is\u001b[67Gmandatory\", \"invalid em\u001b[91Gil\u001b[94Gaddress\") come from EXT:form'\u001b[124G own l\u001b[131Gb\u001b[133Gls. TYPO3\u001b[143Ghas no Kiswahili\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bfor them (it doesn't even know\u001b[36Gthe la\u001b[43Gguage,\u001b[50Gwhich is why th\u001b[66G \u001b[68Gitepackage\u001b[79Gregisters\u001b[89G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249msw\u001b[39m).\u001b[94GSo\u001b[97G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249msw.form.xlf\u001b[109G\u001b[39mneeds\u001b[115Gthem\u001b[120Gtoo,\u001b[125Gas\u001b[128G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mvalidation.error.<code>\u001b[152G\u001b[39mfor\u001b[156Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gvalidators the form uses: NotEmpty, StringL\u001b[49Gngth, EmailAd\u001b[63Gre\u001b[66Gs, RegularExpression.\u001b[88G\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mOutside the form:\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GThe\u001b[9Gheader\u001b[16G\"Write\u001b[23Gto\u001b[26Gus\"\u001b[30Gand\u001b[34Gthe\u001b[38Gsidebar\u001b[46Gtexts\u001b[52Gare\u001b[56Gordinary\u001b[65Gcontent\u001b[73Gelements.\u001b[83GThey\u001b[88Gstay\u001b[93GEnglish\u001b[101Guntil\u001b[107Gthe\u001b[111GContact\u001b[119Gpage\u001b[124Ggets\u001b[129GKiswahili\u001b[139Gcontent,\u001b[148Gwhich\u001b[154Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  seed script could\u001b[23Gdo\u001b[26Glike\u001b[31Git\u001b[34Gdoes\u001b[39Gfor\u001b[43Gthe\u001b[47Ghome\u001b[52Gpage.\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1Bmail to the municipality\u001b[34Gwould show i\u001b[47Gs field labels in\u001b[65GKiswahili wh\u001b[79G \u001b[81Gomeone\u001b[88Gwrites from \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m/sw/\u001b[39m, because \u001b[115Ghe mail template translates them\u001b[148Gtoo. If the\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Boffice should a\u001b[21Gways\u001b[26Gget English mails, the t\u001b[51Gm\u001b[53Glate\u001b[58Gcan\u001b[62Gbe\u001b[65Gpinned\u001b[72Gto\u001b[75GEnglish.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BSh\u001b[6Guld I\u001b[12Gbuild it: the\u001b[26Gtranslat\u001b[35Gon\u001b[38Gfile for the whole form, the error message\u001b[81G moved\u001b[88Gout\u001b[92Gof\u001b[95Gthe\u001b[99GYAML,\u001b[105Gand\u001b[109Gthe\u001b[113GContact\u001b[121Gpage\u001b[126Gcontent\u001b[134Gadded\u001b[140Gto\u001b[143Gthe\u001b[147Gseed\u001b[152Gscript?\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GChurned for 24s · done 7:02 AM\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m※\u001b[3G\u001b[1mrecap: \u001b[22m\u001b[3mThe site now has a Kiswahili version with a working language menu and search, all still uncommitted. I explained how to translate the contact form, \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Band next I'm waiting for your go to build that translation. (turn off recaps in /config)\r\u001b[1B\u001b[23m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mgo\u001b[39m                                                                                                                                                           \r\u001b[2B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[39m Building it. First the error codes and the texts EXT:form uses by default:\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mSearched for \u001b[1m3\u001b[22m patterns, ran \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mOur file at key 20 is read before the core's (10).\u001b[54GNow\u001b[58Gchecking\u001b[67Gwhere\u001b[73Gthe\u001b[77GAltcha\u001b[84Gwidget\u001b[91Ggets\u001b[96Gits\u001b[100Gown\u001b[104Gtexts\u001b[110G(\"I'm\u001b[116Gnot\u001b[120Ga\u001b[122Grobot\"):\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRan \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m shell commands \u001b[25G\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mThe Altcha widget has\u001b[25Gits\u001b[29Gown\u001b[33Gtexts\u001b[39G(\"I'm\u001b[45Gnot\u001b[49Ga\u001b[51Grobot\",\u001b[59G\"Verifying…\"),\u001b[74Gwhich\u001b[80Gthe\u001b[84Gextension\u001b[94Gpasses\u001b[101Gin\u001b[104Gthrough\u001b[112Gan\u001b[115Gempty\u001b[121Gpartial.\u001b[130GChecking\u001b[139Gwhich\u001b[145Gkeys\u001b[150Gthe\u001b[154Gwidget\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Btakes\u001b[9Gand\u001b[13Gwhether\u001b[21Git\u001b[24Gships\u001b[30GKiswahili:\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mRunning \u001b[1m1\u001b[13G\u001b[22ms\u001b[16Gll command…\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  $ A=vendor/bbysaeth/typo3-altcha; ls $A/Resources/Public/JavaScript/ | head; grep -rn \"partialRootPaths\\|Altcha:\" -A6 $A/Configuration/Yaml/*.yaml \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m$A/Configuration/Form/*/config.yaml 2>/dev/null | head -30; grep -o '\"verificationRequired\"\\|ariaLinkLabel\\|waitAlert\\|\"label\":\"[^\"]*\"' -r $A/Resources/…\u001b[39m\u001b[42;1H\u001b[40;3H\u001b[?25h"]
