[2787.162089, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[5Gseed script could do\u001b[26Glike\u001b[31Git does for the home page.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GThe m\u001b[11Gil to the municipality would show its field\u001b[55Glabe\u001b[60Gs in Kiswahili when some\u001b[86Ge\u001b[88Gwrites\u001b[95Gfrom\u001b[100G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m/sw/\u001b[39m,\u001b[106Gbecause\u001b[114Gthe\u001b[118Gmail\u001b[123Gtemplate\u001b[132Gtranslates\u001b[143Gthem\u001b[148Gtoo.\u001b[153GIf\u001b[156Gthe\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Boffice\u001b[12Gshould\u001b[19Galways\u001b[26Gget\u001b[30GEnglish\u001b[38Gmails,\u001b[45Gthe\u001b[49Gtemplate\u001b[58Gcan\u001b[62Gbe\u001b[65Gpinned\u001b[72Gto\u001b[75GEnglish.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BShould I build it: the\u001b[26Gtranslation\u001b[38Gf\u001b[40Gl\u001b[42G for the whole form, the error\u001b[73Gmessage\u001b[81G mov\u001b[86Gd\u001b[88Gout of the YAML, and the Contact page content added to the seed script?\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GChurned for 24s · done 7:02 AM\u001b[34G\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m※\u001b[3G\u001b[1mrecap: \u001b[22m\u001b[3mThe site now has a Kiswahili version with a working language menu and search, all still uncommitted. I explained how to translate the contact form, \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Band next I'm waiting for your go to build that translation. (turn off recaps in /config)\u001b[92G\u001b[23m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mgo\u001b[39m                                                                                                                                                           \r\u001b[2B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mBuilding it. First the error codes and the texts EXT:form uses by default:\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mSearched for \u001b[