[2941.860305, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[19C\u001b[35B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m5\u001b[42G\u001b[38;2;178;178;178mthinking\u001b[39m\u001b[42;1H\u001b[40;3H\u001b[?25h"]
[2941.956507, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[35B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m✻\u001b[42G\u001b[38;2;188;188;188mthinking\u001b[39m\u001b[42;1H\u001b[40;3H\u001b[?25h"]
[2942.022513, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[41C\u001b[35B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mthought for 7s)\u001b[39m\u001b[42;1H\u001b[40;3H\u001b[?25h"]
[2942.109884, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 340 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mkeys are built from the identifiers of the form, its elements and its finishers,                                                             \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 341 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242msuch as `contact.element.name.properties.label`,                                                                                             \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 342 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m`contact.element.topic.properties.options.land`,                                                                                             \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 343 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m`contact.element.contact.renderingOptions.submitButtonLabel` and                                                                             \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 344 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m`contact.finisher.Confirmation.message`. A text without a key stays the one of                                                               \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 345 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m`contact.form.yaml`, in English. `form.xlf` repeats the English texts as the source                                                          \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 346 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mfor the translators. A new field or a changed text needs its key in both files.                                                              \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 347 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m                                                                                                                                             \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 348 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mThe error messages are in the same file. Messages written into the form definition                                                           \r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m49\u001b[12G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m(`validationErrorMessages`) are shown as the\u001b[58Gare, in every language, so the form\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m50\u001b[12G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mkeeps none: the ones for the phone number and the\u001b[62Gspam protection\u001b[78Gar\u001b[82Gkeys\u001b[87Gof the  \r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m51\u001b[12G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mform (`contact.validation.error.phone.1221565130`), and the messages of the  \r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m52\u001b[12G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mvalidators\u001b[23Gare\u001b[27Gkeys\u001b[32Gfor\u001b[36Gevery\u001b[42Gform\u001b[47G(`validation.error.1221560910`).\u001b[80GEXT:form\u001b[89Ghas\u001b[93Gno\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m… +16 lines \r\u001b[1B  ⎿  Allowed by auto mode\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mThe contact form is translated. On \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m/sw/wasiliana-nasi\u001b[39m the labels, the hints, the topic options, the consent text with its link to \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m/sw/sera-ya-faragha\u001b[39m,\u001b[154Gand\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bthe submit button \"Tuma ujumbe\" are all in Kiswahili. The English page is unchanged.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWhat I checked:\u001b[22m I sent the form with empty fields, an invalid email, the phone number \"abc\" and a too-short message. All 7 error messages come back in\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BKiswahili on \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m/sw/\u001b[39m and in English on \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m/contact\u001b[39m. The Contact page's own content also shows in Kiswahili: the heading \"Tuandikie\", the address, the opening\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bhours, \"Report a problem\", and the image's alt text and caption.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mNot tested: a message that actually gets sent.\u001b[22m That needs the \"I'm not a robot\" puzzle solved in a browser. So the Kiswahili confirmation message and the\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BEnglish mail to the office are written but unproven. To check, send the form once from \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m/sw/wasiliana-nasi\u001b[39m and look at the mail in \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mddev mailpit\u001b[39m.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWhat changed:\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mTranslation file:\u001b[22m \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mConfiguration/Form/Sitepackage/config.yaml\u001b[39m points the form framework to the new \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mform.xlf\u001b[39m. \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mform.xlf\u001b[39m holds the English texts and\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249msw.form.xlf\u001b[39m the Kiswahili ones.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mError messages:\u001b[22m the phone and \"I'm not a robot\" messages moved from \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mcontact.f"]
[2942.109928, "o", "orm.yaml\u001b[39m into the XLF, because text written in the YAML is shown untranslated.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249msw.form.xlf\u001b[39m also carries Kiswahili for the standard validator messages, since TYPO3 has none.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mOffice mail:\u001b[22m it stays English, whatever language the visitor uses (\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mtranslation.language: default\u001b[39m on EmailToReceiver).\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mAltcha:\u001b[22m the widget\u001b[24Gswitches\u001b[33Gto\u001b[36GKiswahili\u001b[46Gby\u001b[49Gitself,\u001b[57Gbecause\u001b[65Git\u001b[68Greads\u001b[74Gthe\u001b[78Glanguage\u001b[87Gfrom\u001b[92G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m<html lang>\u001b[104G\u001b[39mand\u001b[108Gships\u001b[114GKiswahili.\u001b[125GNo\u001b[128Gchange\u001b[135Gneeded.\r\u001b[1B  - \u001b[1mContact page content:\u001b[27G\u001b[22m\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mseed-kiswahili.php\u001b[46G\u001b[39mnow\u001b[50Gtranslates\u001b[61Git\u001b[64Gtoo.\u001b[69GI\u001b[71Grestored\u001b[80Gthe\u001b[84Gsnapshot,\u001b[94Gran\u001b[98Gthe\u001b[102Gscript\u001b[109Gagain,\u001b[116Grebuilt\u001b[124Gthe\u001b[128Gsearch\u001b[135Gindex\u001b[141Gand\u001b[145Gexported\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdata.xml\u001b[14G\u001b[39magain.\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G- \u001b[1mREADME:\u001b[22m a new section, \"The form in Kiswahili\", explains\u001b[62Gthe\u001b[66Gkey\u001b[70Gformat.\u001b[78GAny\u001b[82Gnew\u001b[86Gfield\u001b[92Gneeds\u001b[98Gits\u001b[102Gkey\u001b[106Gadded\u001b[112Gin\u001b[115Gboth\u001b[120GXLF\u001b[124Gfiles.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\u001b[42;1H\u001b[40;3H\u001b[?25h"]
[2942.217728, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[9G\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m3\u001b[12G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m`cont\u001b[18Gct.element.con\u001b[33Gact.r\u001b[40Gder\u001b[44GngOptions.submitBu\u001b[63GtonLab\u001b[70Gl` and \u001b[78G   \u001b[82G          \r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m4\u001b[12G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m`cont\u001b[18Gct.fi\u001b[24Gisher.Confirmation.message`. A t\u001b[57Gxt without\u001b[68Ga\u001b[70Gkey\u001b[74Gstays\u001b[80Gthe\u001b[84Gone\u001b[88Gof\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m5\u001b[21G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mfor\u001b[25G.yaml`, in English. `form.xlf` repeats\u001b[64Gthe\u001b[68GEnglish\u001b[76Gtexts\u001b[82Gas\u001b[85Gthe\u001b[89Gsource\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m6\u001b[12G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mfor \u001b[17Ghe transla\u001b[28Gors. A new fi\u001b[42Gld or a changed text needs its\u001b[73Gkey\u001b[77Gin\u001b[80Gboth\u001b[85Gfiles.\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m7\u001b[12G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m                                        \u001b[53G \u001b[55G    \u001b[60G       \u001b[68G \u001b[70G   \u001b[74G     \u001b[80G   \u001b[84G   \u001b[88G  \r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m8\u001b[12G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mThe error messages are in the same file. Messag\u001b[60Gs written into th\u001b[78G form definition \r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m9\u001b[12G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m(`valida\u001b[21Gio\u001b[24GErrorMessages`) are shown\u001b[50Gas th\u001b[56Gy\u001b[58Gare,\u001b[63Gin every language, so\u001b[85Gthe form\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m50\u001b[12G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mkeeps\u001b[18Gnone:\u001b[24Gthe\u001b[28Gones\u001b[33Gfor\u001b[37Gthe\u001b[41Gphone\u001b[47Gnumber\u001b[54Gand\u001b[58Gthe\u001b[62Gspam\u001b[67Gprotection\u001b[78Gare\u001b[82Gkeys\u001b[87Gof\u001b[90Gthe\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m51\u001b[12G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mform (`contact.validatio\u001b[37G.error.phone.1221565130`), and the messages of\u001b[84Gthe       \r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m52\u001b[12G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mvalidators are keys for every form (`v\u001b[51Glidation.\u001b[61Grror.1221560910`). EXT:form\u001b[89Ghas no\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m… +16 lines \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  Allowed by auto mode\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mThe contact form\u001b[20Gis\u001b[23Gtranslated.\u001b[35GOn\u001b[38G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m/sw/wasiliana-nasi\u001b[57G\u001b[39mthe\u001b[61Glabels,\u001b[69Gthe\u001b[73Ghints,\u001b[80Gthe\u001b[84Gtopic\u001b[90Goptions,\u001b[99Gthe\u001b[103Gconsent\u001b[111Gtext\u001b[116Gwith\u001b[121Gits\u001b[125Glink\u001b[130Gto\u001b[133G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m/sw/sera-ya-faragha\u001b[39m,\u001b[154Gand\r\u001b[1B  the submit button \"Tuma\u001b[27Gujumbe\"\u001b[35Gare\u001b[39Gall\u001b[43Gin\u001b[46GKiswahili.\u001b[57GThe\u001b[61GEnglish\u001b[69Gpage\u001b[74Gis\u001b[77Gunchanged.\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3G\u001b[1mWhat I checked:\u001b[22m I \u001b[22Gent the form\u001b[35Gwith empty fields, an\u001b[57Ginva\u001b[62Gid email, t\u001b[74Ge phone number \"abc\" and\u001b[99Ga too-shor\u001b[111Gm\u001b[113Gssage. All 7 error messages come back in\u001b[154G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BKiswahil\u001b[12G on \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m/sw/\u001b[21G\u001b[39mand in English on\u001b[39G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m/contact\u001b[39m. The Contact\u001b[61Gpa\u001b[64Ge'\u001b[67G own content also shows\u001b[91Gin\u001b[94GKiswahili:\u001b[105Gthe\u001b[109Gheading\u001b[117G\"Tuandikie\",\u001b[130Gthe\u001b[134Gaddress,\u001b[143Gthe\u001b[147Gopening\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bhours,\u001b[10G\"Report\u001b[18Ga\u001b[20Gproblem\",\u001b[30Gand\u001b[34Gthe\u001b[38Gimage's\u001b[46Galt\u001b[50Gtext\u001b[55Gand\u001b[59Gcaption.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mNot tested: a message that actually gets sent.\u001b[22m That \u001b[56Geeds\u001b[61Gthe \"I'm \u001b[71Got a robot\" puzzle solved in a brows\u001b[108Gr. So the Kiswahili confirmation message a\u001b[151Gd the\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BEnglish mail \u001b[17Go the office\u001b[31Gre\u001b[34Gwritten but\u001b[46Gunproven. To\u001b[60Gheck, send\u001b[71Gthe\u001b[75Gform\u001b[80Gonce\u001b[85Gfrom\u001b[90G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m/sw/wasiliana-nasi\u001b[109G\u001b[39mand\u001b[113Glook\u001b[118Gat\u001b[121Gthe\u001b[125Gmail\u001b[130Gin\u001b[133G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mddev mailpit\u001b[39m.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2B\u001b[1mWhat changed:\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- \u001b[1mTranslation file:\u001b[23G\u001b[22m\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mConfiguration/Form/Sitepackage/config.yaml\u001b[66G\u001b[39mpoints the form framework to the new \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mform.xlf\u001b[39m.\u001b[113G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mform.xlf\u001b[39m \u001b[123Golds the English texts and\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249msw.form.xlf\u001b[17G\u001b[39mthe\u001b[21GKiswahili\u001b[31Gones.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- \u001b[1mError messages:\u001b[21G\u001b[22mthe\u001b[25Gphone\u001b[31Gand\u001b[35G\"I'm\u001b[40Gnot\u001b[44Ga\u001b[46Grobot\"\u001b[53Gmessages\u001b[62Gmoved\u001b[68Gfrom\u001b[73G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mcontact.form.yaml\u001b[91G\u001b[39minto\u001b[96Gthe\u001b[100GXLF,\u001b[105Gbecause\u001b[113Gtext\u001b[118Gwritten\u001b[126Gin\u001b[129Gthe\u001b[133GYAML\u001b[138Gis\u001b[141Gshown\u001b[147Guntranslated.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249msw.form.xlf\u001b[39m also carries Kiswahili for the standard validator messages,\u001b[77Gsince TYPO3 has none.\u001b[99G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mOff"]
[2942.217842, "o", "ice mail:\u001b[22m it\u001b[21Gstays English, whatever\u001b[45Glanguage\u001b[54Gthe\u001b[58Gvisitor\u001b[66Guses\u001b[71G(\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mtranslation.language: default\u001b[102G\u001b[39mon\u001b[105GEmailToReceiver).\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mAltcha:\u001b[22m the widget switches to Kiswahili\u001b[46Gby i\u001b[51Gself, because it\u001b[68Greads the language from \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m<html lang>\u001b[39m and ships Kiswah\u001b[121Gli. No change needed.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mContact page content:\u001b[22m \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mseed-kiswahili.php\u001b[39m now translates it too. I restored the snaps\u001b[90Got, ran the\u001b[102Gscript\u001b[109Gagain,\u001b[116Grebuilt\u001b[124Gthe\u001b[128Gsearch\u001b[135Gindex\u001b[141Gand\u001b[145Gexported\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdata.xml\u001b[39m again.\u001b[21G\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mREADME\u001b[13G\u001b[22ma ne\u001b[18G sec\u001b[23Gion, \"The\u001b[33Gf\u001b[35Grm in K\u001b[43Gswahil\u001b[50G\", explains the key format.\u001b[78GAny new field\u001b[92Gneeds its key added in both XLF files.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BNothing is\u001b[14Gcommitted.\u001b[25GShould\u001b[32GI\u001b[34Gprepare\u001b[42Gthe\u001b[46G\"Stage\u001b[53G14-languages\"\u001b[67Gcommit\u001b[74Gand\u001b[78Gshow\u001b[83Gyou\u001b[87Gthe\u001b[91Gmessage?\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m✶\u001b[3GCogitating… \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m(3m 25s · ↓\u001b[27G20.8k tokens)\u001b[39m\u001b[42;1H\u001b[40;3H\u001b[?25h"]
